   "hub_id": null,
   "version": "2.1.0",
   "description": "<h3><strong>This version will only work for SPT 4.0.x</strong></h3>\n<p>New Features</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Configurable number of reps</li>\n<li>Configurable weighted skill selection (no longer just Strength+Endurance)</li>\n<li>Configurable Energy/Hydration</li>\n<li>Skill exp multipliers are now every 10 levels instead of 0, 10 and 25</li>\n<li>Non Easy-Mode is fully configurable with options for speed, size, and difficulty (Exponential or Linear)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Now includes a client side!</p>\n",
   "link": "https://sp-mod.com/mod/download/1437/simple-workout-qte/2.1.0",
   "content_length": 12284,
   "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0 <4.1.0",
